on for it.\n\nI'll leave details to you, thank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yohh_angel/works/29", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/379da6f3/uploads/origins/8c8e7496-febe-47ba-bcf1-dfc823766bc6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f16beadf44b30053a1b4f46f2f54d60e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/379da6f3/uploads/origins/8c8e7496-febe-47ba-bcf1-dfc823766bc6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f16beadf44b30053a1b4f46f2f54d60e, https://si.imgix.net/379da6f3/uploads/origins/8c8e7496-febe-47ba-bcf1-dfc823766bc6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5bd3bb7f867026781c76c9f67753b92 2x, https://si.imgix.net/379da6f3/uploads/origins/8c8e7496-febe-47ba-bcf1-dfc823766bc6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b64cbbc56c099f040518afe08871d8fd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "yohh先生 こんにちは\n\n今回もメア・S・エフェメラルのイラストを依頼したいです！\nメアの誕生日祝いの絵を描いてもらいたいと思います\n今回も衣装とポーズなどはお任せします！\n更に猫耳・尻尾をついてるものでお願いしたいです。\n\n可能であれば、全着と半脱ぎの差分もつけて頂けましたら幸いです。\nありがとうございます！\n\nその他の参考資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hDCtILX8Hp69eVtmdFDk45z_oJyGGCMg?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yohh_angel/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a4d2b3a/uploads/origins/495422ae-bb3a-4b7e-87ca-f03f19725ba0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c0a4deba2cca6ed31110586cd492233", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3a4d2b3a/uploads/origins/495422ae-bb3a-4b7e-87ca-f03f19725ba0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c0a4deba2cca6ed31110586cd492233, https://si.imgix.net/3a4d2b3a/uploads/origins/4